        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/6f9a4e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-11T14:25:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When powers say something like Do 1 target 2 dmg, target 2 2 dmg, target 3 1 dmg, Can you perform all those attacks on the same target or is that against the rules? Does each attack have to land on 3 different villains. Also, does this apply to healing? such as argent adepts heal 5 targets 1 HP? Do these heals factor in + to dmg?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:00.102Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
