      {
        "id": 59534,
        "name": "dypaca",
        "username": "dypaca",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dypaca/{size}/2079_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-11T14:47:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For Bunker's card which says&nbsp;\"a second target\" and \"a third target\", they have to be different because otherwise it isn't a second and third target, it is just the first one again.&nbsp; Most cards are written like this.</p><p>There are a few cards (Argent Adept and Chrono Ranger) which just say deal a target some damage, deal a target some other damage.&nbsp; This can be the same target both times.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:35:21.546Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 7663,
        "topic_slug": "multiple-targets",
        "display_username": "dypaca",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
